flowchart TD
    T[Fixed task and fixture] --> A[Agent attempt]
    A --> O{Required artifact exists?}
    O -->|No| F[Record failed attempt]
    O -->|Yes| V{Behavior checks pass?}
    V -->|No| F
    V -->|Yes| P[Record accepted result]
    F --> B{Budget remains?}
    B -->|Yes| H[New failure hypothesis]
    H --> A
    B -->|No| S[Stop with evidence]
    P --> S
